WEBVTT

00:08:29.516 --> 00:08:31.036
may feel threatening to those

00:08:31.076 --> 00:08:33.876
who see only the short-term profits
of their destruction.

00:08:34.676 --> 00:08:36.276
But I am hopeful

00:08:36.316 --> 00:08:40.236
because I have seen with my own eyes
how nature can recover

00:08:40.276 --> 00:08:41.916
in those marine reserves.

00:08:45.876 --> 00:08:48.116
And I have seen how the return of nature

00:08:48.156 --> 00:08:51.316
has helped people thrive
and build a better life.

00:08:53.876 --> 00:08:57.276
We just need to give nature
the space it needs

00:08:57.316 --> 00:09:00.396
so she can continue providing for us.